# Retail Sales Analytics Using MySQL and Tableau

## Project Overview
This project analyzes retail sales data using MySQL and Tableau Public to generate meaningful business insights.

## Technologies Used
- MySQL
- phpMyAdmin
- Tableau Public
- SQL
- CSV

## Key Features
- Monthly Revenue and Profit Analysis
- Top 5 Products by Revenue
- Category-wise Revenue Analysis
- City-wise Sales Performance
- Customer Activity Analysis
- Interactive Tableau Dashboard

